		"---------------------------------"
		"A named Armorsaurus can be equipped with a saddle and saddlebags using a Monster Saddle and a Chest. Allowing it to be ridden, the storage is equivalent to two chests. "
		""
		"Using the mount ability key &l(Default R)&r causes the Armorsaurus to turn and make a tail swipe. When ridden, the Armorsaurus causes block destruction dependent on where the rider is looking. If looking upwards, moving forwards will break blocks in a upwards staircase, looking downwards, the opposite."
		""
		" Broken blocks are placed in the saddlebags, if the saddlebags are full, or there are no saddlebags, drops will be placed on the ground."
		""
		"Heavily armored subterranean beasts are disrupting mining operations in the mountain regions. Crack their shells."
		""
		""
		"Spawns in Mesa and Mountain biomes. Features high defensive armor points, making them tedious to kill without magical skills."
	]
